WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — eco-stack (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.926
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, imọ-ẹrọ alaye, imọ-ẹrọ ere, ati apẹrẹ ọna ṣiṣe ṣe awọn ipele mẹta ti atokọ kọmputa kan.

2
00:00:08.006 --> 00:00:17.032
<v Narrator>Keji, ọkan ṣe awọn idiyele ati awọn bit, ọkan ṣe awọn maapu ilana, ati ọkan kọ awọn ofin nibiti igbẹkẹle ti gba.

3
00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:29.390
<v Narrator>Ni gbogbo igba ti a ba sọrọ nipa awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe, o yẹ ki a ṣe akiyesi pe wọn jẹ awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ti ara ẹni ati pe ko ni ibatan si awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ti ile-iṣẹ.
